---
import Divider from '../../components/divider/Divider.astro';
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid-container">
    <div class="col-span-4">
      <h2 class="text-black">What I get praised for</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-8">
      <div class="col2grid" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <div>
          <p class="text-black">Attention to detail</p>
          <p>
            I believe the quality of a system is the sum of its smallest parts.
            Whether it’s pixel-perfect UI execution or edge-case handling in
            state management, I obsess over the details that bridge the gap
            between "working" and "polished."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-black">Bringing the new</p>
          <p>
            I'm an avid student of the latest tech and the digital frontier. I
            specialize in integrating modern tooling and up-to-date
            patterns—like React Server Components or advanced motion
            libraries—to keep platforms performant and future-proof.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-black">High-velocity exploration</p>
          <p>
            I’ve optimized my workflow for a quick turnaround without
            sacrificing depth. By moving fast through the "gnarly" initial
            stages, I can explore a larger volume of solutions, allowing more
            time for the thoughtful refinement that 0-to-1 projects require.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-black">Design 🤝 Engineering</p>
          <p>
            As an engineer who lives where logic meets creativity, I speak both
            languages fluently. I don't just hand off or receive designs; I
            architect frontend systems that respect the designer’s vision while
            maintaining the technical rigor of a scalable codebase.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Divider />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .col2grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 4rem 1rem;
    grid-auto-rows: auto;
    margin: auto;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  @media only screen and (max-width: 31.25em) {
    .col2grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
